[?2004l[?2004h> # Incident Remediation & Recovery Plan
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Executive Summary
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> This remediation plan addresses the post-compromise state of `struts-prod-01`. All remediation actions adhere to forensic best practices (preferring quarantine/backup over immediate deletion to preserve evidence) and are fully mapped to cited evidence.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004li[?2004h> ## Reconciled Remediation Change Ticket CHG-7100
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> | # | Action | Target / Path | Status | Evidence Citation & Note |
[?2004l[?2004h> |---|--------|---------------|--------|--------------------------|
