[?2004l[?2004h> | 2 | Patch Apache Struts2 vulnerability (CVE-2023-50164) | `/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar` | OPEN (Proposed) | `/disk/opt/tomcat/lib/struts2-core.jar:1`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:23` — Corrected from erroneous BlueKeep (CVE-2019-0708) entry. |
