[?2004l[?2004h> | 4 | Quarantine webshell file | `/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp` | OPEN (Proposed) | `/disk/opt/tomcat/webapps/ROOT/static/upload.jsp:1`, `/sas/alerts.json:1` — Quarantine JSP webshell outside web root. |
